  <reason>Subject and account: The subject of this report is Hina Qadir, holder of account PK**UNIL****7411, opened on 24 December 2023. The customer's declared occupation is medical sales officer (salaried), with a declared income of PKR 185,000 per month.

Activity summary: During the period 1 June 2026 to 30 June 2026, the account recorded 18 credits totalling PKR 27,036,000 as well as 6 debits totalling PKR 23,361,000. The credits included 17 cash deposits totalling PKR 26,851,000, made over the counter at 3 branches (Clifton Branch, DHA Phase 6 Branch, Saddar Branch). The activity was detected on 30 June 2026, when Tazama typology STR-PK-01 scored 320 against an alert threshold of 300.

Grounds for suspicion: 13 of 17 cash deposits (76%) were between PKR 1,600,000 and PKR 1,999,999, totalling PKR 23,365,000, just below the cash transaction reporting threshold of PKR 2,000,000. The cash was deposited across 3 branches (Clifton Branch, DHA Phase 6 Branch, Saddar Branch) rather than at a single branch. The customer made more than one cash deposit on 2 days (12 June 2026, 20 June 2026). Credits in the activity window were 146.1 times the declared monthly income, against a declared income of PKR 185,000 per month. A note by Branch Operations (14 June 2026): "Customer asked why deposits of PKR 2 million or more need extra paperwork and declined to explain the source of the cash." Taken together, these indicators are consistent with suspected structuring; the reporting entity has not established the underlying offence.

Flow of funds: Of the outgoing funds, PKR 9,389,000 was sent to Sheraz Traders (PK**SHER****1518, Synthetic Bank A) in 2 transactions. Of the outgoing funds, PKR 7,876,000 was sent to Crescent Imports (PK**CRES****1592, Synthetic Bank A) in 2 transactions. Of the outgoing funds, PKR 6,096,000 was sent to Al-Noor Exchange Company (PK**AL-N****1888, Synthetic Bank B) in 2 transactions. Funds did not remain in the account: debits equal to 86% of credits, with a median of 2.9 hours between the latest credit and each debit.

Other considerations: Screening of the subject returned no match on sanctions, PEP or adverse-media screening on 28 June 2026.

Action taken by the reporting entity: Action taken: a note by L2 analyst (28 June 2026): "Account placed under enhanced monitoring pending the reporting decision. No contact made with the customer about this review."</reason>
